on mouseUp
  [  0] pushsymb 30 ............................. <#stop>
  [  2] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  5] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <1>
  [  7] extcall 16 .............................. sound stop 1
  [  9] pushsymb 30 ............................. <#stop>
  [ 11] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 14] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <2>
  [ 16] extcall 16 .............................. sound stop 2
  [ 18] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 20] extcall 35 .............................. quit()
  [ 23] ret
end
